2026-06-05 11:28:58,696 | AGENT | ProjectCoordinator Agent answered: Based on our company context, I propose a project management approach that leverages our experience with PRINCE2, Agile Scrum, and SAFe methodologies. Given the progressive nature of the project, we can adopt an iterative approach that allows for flexibility and adaptability.

